<title>UK: Royal Dutch announces 4-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Royal Dutch announces 4-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Dutch Petroleum Co, the Dutch arm of oil giant Royal/Shell Group, said each of its ordinary shares will be split in four new shares from June 30.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
